The datasheet describes a single product (TSD001-S31C-SO) with one 100GBASE-DR application. The listed multi-values are different measures for the same configuration (aggregated vs line rate, average vs OMA sensitivity, one FEC type with two wordings, one optical lane vs two electrical 100GAUI-2 lanes)—not separate selectable operating modes. One mode is supported by the ordering table and technical data.

